faq:
  - q: Should salespeople see margins?
    a: Most companies keep margin with the people who set prices, and give sales the selling price and the approved discount range.
  - q: Can one person hold several roles?
    a: Yes, in a system that supports it, a person can hold multiple roles and switch between them as their work changes.
  - q: How do we handle people who leave?
    a: Remove access the same day and review the actions they took in their last weeks.
